# 批判：Optional 容器委托完整矩阵（有值 len/下标/迭代/切片/append/越界传播）
# doc: docs/architecture/03_type_system.md §8
# expect-class: PASS
# expect-out: 3 | 9 | 4 | 2 | 2 | caught
# expect-exit: 0
Optional[list[int]] b = [1, 2, 3]
print(len(b))
b[0] = 9
print(b[0])
b.append(4)
print(len(b))
print(b[1])
Optional[list[int]] s = b[1:3]
print(len(s))
try:
    print(b[99])
except:
    print("caught")
